# Engagement workspaces live under $LOOM_ENGAGEMENTS_ROOT (default ~/engagements),
# OUTSIDE this repo, by design (see docs/engagements-path.md and AGENTS.md
# "Engagement data hygiene"). The rules below are defense-in-depth: even if a root is
# ever pointed inside the clone, no customer-identifying asset may be committed.

# In-repo engagements/ holds only the pointer README — never customer data.
/engagements/*
!/engagements/README.md

# Secret-bearing env files in ANY directory. Credentials and customer-identifying
# fields belong in the secrets vault (injected env vars), never a committed .env.
# Safe, credential-free templates stay tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env-sample

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Editor workspace files
*.code-workspace

# Local agent scratch/planning artifacts
.scratch/
.cursor/plans/
